{
  "slug": "tofu-spinach-lentil-curry",
  "name": "Tofu, spinach and lentil curry",
  "description": "A quick weeknight curry of cubed tofu and lentils simmered with tomato, onion and warm spices, finished with a large handful of spinach.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the canola oil in a large pan over medium heat and cook the onion for 4 minutes, until soft.",
    "Add the garlic, the ground cumin and the chili powder and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the chopped tomato and cook for 3 minutes, pressing it down so it breaks into a sauce.",
    "Add the tofu and the lentils with the salt and simmer for 6 minutes, stirring gently so the tofu stays whole.",
    "Fold in the spinach a handful at a time and cook for 2 minutes more, until it has all wilted into the curry."
  ],
